  "instruction": "Turn on captions in the opened YouTube video and create a complete child-visit preparation checklist in a Sticky Note. Include the recommended clothing, ways to comfort or distract the child, after-vaccination comfort measures, the record to bring, and how long to remain after the appointment.",
  "source": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2BuJuk4BQIs",
  "gt_steps": [
    "Turn on captions in the YouTube player.",
    "Play the video and use the YouTube captions to identify every recommendation in the requested checklist categories.",
    "Switch to Sticky Notes.",
    "Write the phrases in a sticky note: `short sleeve shirt`, `easy to remove`, `holding and talking`, `breastfeeding`, `favourite toy`, `music`, `book`, `bandage`, `reward`, `vaccination record`, `15 minutes`."
  ],
